<title>SWITZERLAND: Valora 1996 sales rise 1.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Valora 1996 sales rise 1.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p>Total group sales   2,913 vs 2,869</p>
<p>-- Sales according to division</p>
<p>Kiosk-Merkur sales  1,415 vs 1,404</p>
<p>Alimarca sales  231 vs 201</p>
<p>Selecta sales  640 vs 621</p>
<p>Slumberland sales  627 vs 643</p>
<p>Note - Full names is Valora Holding AG. Company changed name from Merkur Holding AG in 1996.    -- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
